2.4. Statistical Analysis
The data obtained were subjected to one-way analysis of variance (ANOVA), and differences between samples at P ≤0.05
were separated by Duncan multiple range test using the Statistical Package for Social Sciences (SPSS 23) program.
Experimental results were expressed (where appropriate) as mean ± SDV (standard deviation).

