+title: "Assessment of Human Health Risk Based on Analysis of Potentially Toxic Elements in African Foods Sold in the UK Market"
+authors: [Brima EI, Haris PI, Frei M]
+year: 2025
+publication: "African Journal of Agriculture and Food Science"
+doi: 10.52589/AJAFS-TWSMWEGM
+source_type: peer-reviewed
+evidence_tier: A
